  "title": "Royalty Pharma to announce second quarter 2026 financial results on August 5, 2026",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, NY, July 15, 2026 — Royalty Pharma plc (Nasdaq: RPRX) today announced that it will report its second quarter 2026 financial results on Wednesday, August 5, 2026 before the U.S. financial markets open. The company will host a conference call and simultaneous webcast at 8:00 a.m. Eastern Time that day.",
